{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415805","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415805","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041580501:1":{"text":"아로라, 일어나.","source_cn":"奥萝菈，醒醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4B9DCAABCBBD5CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580502:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580503:1":{"text":"...아로라, 일어나!","source_cn":"……奥萝菈，醒醒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27490BB363B679BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580504:1":{"text":"음... 마렌... 무슨 일이에요?","source_cn":"唔……是卓琳啊……有什么事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9E6616BE03A88FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580505:1":{"text":"네 도움이 필요한 일이 있어.","source_cn":"有件事需要你帮忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x941625CC05510C32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580506:1":{"text":"바다에 갑자기 폭풍우가 몰아쳐서 어선 두 척이 갇혔어! 내가 직접 가기엔 시간이 너무 걸려. 꿈을 통해 가는 편이 훨씬 빠르다고!","source_cn":"海上突然出现暴风雨，有两艘渔船被困在里面。我赶过去需要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3BBAA692426F08A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580507:1":{"text":"하지만 저는 꿈을 통해 당신을 그곳으로 보낼 수 없는걸요... 직접 가는 수밖에...","source_cn":"可是，我没办法通过梦境将你传送过去……我只能自己前往那里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD440DB27C428E23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580508:1":{"text":"어부들이 살아남을 수 있게 구조 물품을 좀 옮겨 줘.","source_cn":"你可以替我运一些救生用品过去，帮渔民们保命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA132D484117045D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580509:1":{"text":"네에...","source_cn":"没问题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3666396984AA96DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580510:1":{"text":"어선의 위치와 인근 마을의 위치가 필요해요.","source_cn":"我需要渔船的位置，还有临近村庄的位置。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13791AA1D5EFBB33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580511:1":{"text":"인근 마을 위치는 왜? 그럴 시간 없어!","source_cn":"临近村庄的位置？要这做什么？时间很紧迫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F37752785DD6504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041580512:1":{"text":"폭풍우가 몰아쳤으니 어선에 탄 사람들이 편히 잠들기는 어렵겠죠... 꿈이 없으면 갈 수 없는데...","source_cn":"暴风雨来临，渔船上的人应该很难安眠才对……没有梦境，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD26EFCC43DA60C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041580513:1":{"text":"만약 그렇다면 그 주변 사람들의 꿈을 통해 가는 수밖에 없어요.","source_cn":"以防万一，我只能从临近的人们的梦境里前往。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBC60B4DFA9D43F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041580514:1":{"text":"아, 그리고 운송할 물품 목록도 필요해요. 괜찮으시다면...","source_cn":"对了，我还需要运输物品的清单。如果方便的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C6B2B68105E524A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041580515:1":{"text":"아니... 시간이 그렇게 많은 게 아니라고!","source_cn":"啧……没有那么多时间了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CACBF42734FDC4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041580516:1":{"text":"최대한 빨리 가 봐야겠어! 꿈속 텔레포트 얘기는 다음에 하자!","source_cn":"我得尽快赶过去！梦境传送的事下次再说吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFDA9A5AA6286851","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_inde